        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "If we lost one or more of these significant purchasers and were unable to sell our production to other purchasers on terms we consider acceptable, it could materially and adversely affect our business, financial condition, results of operations and cash flows.",
