        "accession_number": "0001520006-26-000002",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Additionally, we realized approximately 12.8 million BOE in net upward revisions of prior estimates of proved developed reserves in 2025, including positive forecast updates of 16.7 million BOE and ownership updates of 3.2 million BOE.",
