        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "At December 31, 2025, we had a total of 150 gross (52.1 net) development wells and 11 gross (1.0 net) exploration wells that were in the process of being drilled, being completed or awaiting completion operations.",
