        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "At December 31, 2025, we had no proved undeveloped reserves in our estimates that remained undeveloped for five years or more following their initial booking, and we currently have plans to use anticipated capital resources to develop the proved undeveloped reserves remaining as of December 31, 2025 within five years of booking these reserves.",
